.TH "role:list" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
role:list \- Lists security roles and access groups.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php role:list
[\-\-json] [\-\-app=\fIAPP\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetches and displays defined security roles from the framework database.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Outputs results in structured JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-\-app =\fIAPP\fR
Targets a specific application context.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Queries the spp_roles table and serializes output.
